Ok The basics are ... Boot from the CD, follow the prompts.
The specifics are in the install guide, location depends on the exact
version of Tru64 you are installing.
Take a look at http://www.tru64.org/pages.php?page=Documentation which is a
better index to the docs than HP provide.
If you want ssh from HP then you probably should go for version 5.1b
In which case the install guide is here...
http://h30097.www3.hp.com/docs/base_doc/DOCUMENTATION/V51B_HTML/ARH8SETE/TITLE.HTM

If you want one of the other versions then the links on tru64.org should
get you there.
On the other hand you could just install OpenSSH.
HTH
Adam


