Just a quick guess...

Have a look at your last command (when you're asking for the mirror
set)...

volmake -g rootdg -U fsgen vol sparevol2
plex=sparevol2-01,sparevol2-01

I'm guessing you're trying to create mirror between the sparevol2-01
and sparevol2-02 plexes ?

If so - try the following: -

volmake -g rootdg -U fsgen vol sparevol2
plex=sparevol2-01,sparevol2-02

Cheers

Gary


